tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T17:26:40Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T17:26:40Z","body":"No they shouldn't be edited directly, it shouldn't be assigned manually by design, that way you don't manually share them (the duplication issue should be fixed separately)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985134226/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985161630","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107675#issuecomment-2985161630","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107675","id":2985161630,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x7fOe","user":{"login":"zedrun00","id":104408400,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjklUA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104408400?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00","html_url":"https://github.com/zedrun00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zedrun00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T17:37:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T17:37:58Z","body":"> No they shouldn't be edited directly, it shouldn't be assigned manually by design, that way you don't manually share them (the duplication issue should be fixed separately)\r\n\r\nDirect editing? No!​​ The SceneReplicationConfig class does not expose any public properties, so it ​​cannot be directly edited in the property inspector​​. It still relies on the ​​Replication Editor​​.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb7f83a7-d434-49cc-91e7-b975a49f0625)\r\n\r\n\r\nThe only reason we exposed replication_config was to enable localization in inherited scenes. This is necessary because inherited scenes might contain ​​extended nodes that require synchronization​​, and we need to save the SceneReplicationConfig resource to the ​​current extended scene​​ rather than modifying the ​​base scene​​.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985161630/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985172555","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107675#issuecomment-2985172555","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107675","id":2985172555,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x7h5L","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T17:42:27Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T17:42:27Z","body":"You can still copy it, and if it doesn't have any properties it makes no sense to expose it","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985172555/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136483696","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107675#issuecomment-3136483696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107675","id":3136483696,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc668vFw","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T13:59:46Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T13:59:46Z","body":"I was about to propose something like this :P\r\n\r\nEven though `SceneReplicationConfig` does not have any properties, exposing it shows that the node is referencing a resource and makes it easier to make the resource unique after copying the node / inheriting the scene.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136483696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136495896","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107675#issuecomment-3136495896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107675","id":3136495896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc668yEY","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T14:02:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T14:05:02Z","body":"I'd say it's better to properly enforce that it is unique, the resource should never be shared in the first place, what would being able to access it add? It shouldn't be saved as a separate file (as it shouldn't be shared) and it shouldn't be copy-pasted except uniquely, is there a significant demand for creating identical copies?\r\n\r\nFor further support for saving/loading configurations or copy/pasting entries I'd say the scene replication dock should be improved instead to avoid having to add a lot of extra things to ensure this isn't abused etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136495896/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]